Description: Windows 95-style Wayland desktop
 A complete desktop session in the style of Windows 95: a Wayland
 compositor (wlroots) with Win95 window frames, a taskbar, Start menu and
 desktop, plus its own File Manager, Notepad, Terminal, Control Panel,
 System Monitor and file dialogs for other programs. Log in to it as
 "Wayland 95".
